adoption fails closed: every tool meta-dev requires must run on every change
- ci: ci.yml job ci can skip it through a `||` fallback; fix: drop that so it always runs on pull_request
- cargo-deny is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci`: `uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-deny@0.20.2`
- cargo-semver-checks is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci` (`uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-semver-checks@0.51.0`) and list your library crates in `[supply_chain] semver`
- full-mutants: ci.yml job full can skip it through its workflow does not run on push or schedule; fix: drop that so it always runs on push or schedule
- stacked: ci.yml job stacked can skip it through job `if: github.event_name == 'pull_request'`; fix: drop that so it always runs on pull_request
- dependabot-alerts: dependabot alerts: fails closed in CI: false api repos/{owner}/{repo}/dependabot/alerts?state=open&per_page=100 --jq length failed:
; fix: turn on Dependabot alerts, store a fine-grained token with repository permission "Dependabot alerts: read" as secret DEPENDABOT_TOKEN, pass it as env `GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.DEPENDABOT_TOKEN }}` to the step that runs `cargo xtask ci` (github.token cannot read alerts), and fix or dismiss every open alert
adoption fails closed: every tool meta-dev requires must run on every change
- ci: ci.yml job ci can skip it through a pipe without `shell: bash`, so no pipefail; fix: drop that so it always runs on pull_request
- cargo-deny is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci`: `uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-deny@0.20.2`
- cargo-semver-checks is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci` (`uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-semver-checks@0.51.0`) and list your library crates in `[supply_chain] semver`
- diff-mutants: lint.yml job lint can skip it through `continue-on-error`; fix: drop that so it always runs on pull_request
- dependabot-alerts:  open alerts; fix: turn on Dependabot alerts, store a fine-grained token with repository permission "Dependabot alerts: read" as secret DEPENDABOT_TOKEN, pass it as env `GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.DEPENDABOT_TOKEN }}` to the step that runs `cargo xtask ci` (github.token cannot read alerts), and fix or dismiss every open alert
adoption fails closed: every tool meta-dev requires must run on every change
- ci: no workflow step runs it in unrun; fix: add a step `run: cargo xtask ci` (checkout with fetch-depth: 0) to a workflow on pull_request
- cargo-deny is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci`: `uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-deny@0.20.2`
- cargo-semver-checks is not installed; fix: install it before `cargo xtask ci` (`uses: taiki-e/install-action@v2` with `tool: cargo-semver-checks@0.51.0`) and list your library crates in `[supply_chain] semver`
- diff-mutants: no workflow step runs it in unrun; fix: add a step `run: cargo xtask mutants` (cargo-mutants@27.1.0 installed, checkout with fetch-depth: 0) to a workflow on pull_request
- full-mutants: no workflow step runs it in unrun; fix: add a step `run: cargo xtask mutants-full` (cargo-mutants@27.1.0 installed) to a workflow on push or schedule, and list "weekly" in `[mutation] full_run`
- stacked: no workflow step runs it in unrun; fix: add a step `run: cargo xtask stacked` with env GH_TOKEN and PULL_REQUEST (permissions: pull-requests: read) to a workflow on pull_request
- dependabot-updates: .github/dependabot.yml does not list unrun; fix: list this workspace in .github/dependabot.yml: an `updates` entry with `package-ecosystem: cargo`, `directory: /<workspace path>` and `schedule: interval: weekly`